<main class="zd-blokkr">

  <section class="zdb-hero">
    <div class="zdb-hero__visual">
      <img
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDNmmfCsH2wkKIic1auKPW9U9px3FVZtc9LKraKWSOVU6ex-77Ra4N9ArmC91U7voWHzjVAR7GWjxbzDldalUW56ATsYZ4IMMOqj_EvmOVbu7vzE8VmLxzawVN4OENpQegKAN2O6SNzBOGbw7nUEutD7cHFn5nrpqVjPq-89J5cHZcgzT-TKogLWfxOaf8hT-ltJ9uxFx0wxkWMfbPaqTU_N8mz2EcNgX5441KZhjkDI1b8jzr1TDZx2xsdVtV6IrvT0-ZtXbyLc2ro"
        alt="Blokkr focus environment preview"
        width="1000"
        height="900"
      >

      <div class="zdb-floating-note">
        <span>Focus Shield</span>
        <strong>Block the noise before it takes over.</strong>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="zdb-hero__copy">
      <p class="zdb-eyebrow">Blokkr</p>
      <h1>A quiet barrier between you and distraction.</h1>
      <p>
        Blokkr is a focus app concept designed to protect attention, reduce digital
        friction, and help users stay present with the work that matters.
      </p>

      <div class="zdb-status-chips">
        <span>Focus Tool</span>
        <span>Concept Stage</span>
        <span>Ziyu Ecosystem</span>
      </div>

      <div class="zdb-actions">
        <a href="/pages/support">Support Development</a>
        <a href="/pages/projects">View Projects</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdb-intro">
    <p class="zdb-eyebrow">The Problem</p>
    <h2>Attention is constantly being pulled away.</h2>
    <p>
      Most apps compete to keep people inside them. Blokkr is designed around the
      opposite goal: helping people create boundaries, avoid distraction loops, and
      return to deep work without fighting their phone all day.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="zdb-grid">
    <article class="zdb-card zdb-card--wide">
      <span>01</span>
      <h3>Block distraction before it starts.</h3>
      <p>
        Blokkr is imagined as a focus barrier that helps interrupt automatic habits,
        app switching, and attention leaks before they become a lost hour.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdb-card">
      <span>02</span>
      <h3>Reduce digital friction.</h3>
      <p>
        The goal is not complicated productivity. The goal is simple protection for
        your attention when you are trying to work, study, create, or rest.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdb-card zdb-card--dark">
      <span>03</span>
      <h3>Built for intentional focus.</h3>
      <p>
        Blokkr supports the Ziyu philosophy: technology should help people return
        to real life stronger, not disappear into endless screens.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdb-card">
      <span>04</span>
      <h3>Calm, not controlling.</h3>
      <p>
        Instead of aggressive lockouts or shame-based productivity, Blokkr would use
        gentle structure, clear boundaries, and intentional design.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="zdb-flow">
    <div class="zdb-section-head">
      <p class="zdb-eyebrow">How It Could Work</p>
      <h2>A simple system for protecting focus.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="zdb-flow-list">
      <article>
        <span>Step 01</span>
        <h3>Choose your focus session.</h3>
        <p>Select what you are trying to protect: study, work, writing, prayer, reading, or rest.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Step 02</span>
        <h3>Set the boundary.</h3>
        <p>Decide which apps, sites, or habits should stay outside the session.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Step 03</span>
        <h3>Stay inside the work.</h3>
        <p>Blokkr helps reduce the urge to switch, scroll, or escape when focus gets uncomfortable.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Step 04</span>
        <h3>Return with intention.</h3>
        <p>When the session ends, you re-enter your digital space with more awareness.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdb-status">
    <div>
      <p class="zdb-eyebrow">Project Status</p>
      <h2>Blokkr is part of the future Ziyu ecosystem.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is the main project being built right now. Blokkr is a future
        focus tool concept that supports the same mission: intentional technology
        for real-life growth.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="zdb-status-list">
      <article>
        <span>Concept</span>
        <h3>Focus barrier</h3>
        <p>A tool for protecting attention from distraction loops.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Future</span>
        <h3>Digital boundaries</h3>
        <p>A calmer way to block distractions without making productivity feel harsh.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Connected</span>
        <h3>Ziyu ecosystem</h3>
        <p>Designed to support Goal Grower, MyJourney, KindLitt, and future apps.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdb-cta">
    <p class="zdb-eyebrow">Support the Mission</p>
    <h2>Help build tools that protect attention.</h2>
    <p>
      Support Ziyu Development, follow the roadmap, or join the community as projects
      move from concept to real products.
    </p>

    <div class="zdb-actions">
      <a href="/pages/support">Support Development</a>
      <a href="/pages/community">Join the Community</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

